'' RUN: std/numeric CurrentLocaleFormat reads the OS's decimal and thousands separators
'' (GetLocaleInfoEx on Windows, compared with an independent read; a private newlocale on
'' Linux, run there by hand) and leaves the process locale alone, so ToString is unchanged.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/codegen/src/std-numeric-locale.tiko -o tests/codegen/stdnumlocale.exe
'' ENV: TIKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-FILE: tests/codegen/stdnumlocale.exe
'' RUN: tests/codegen/stdnumlocale.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: ok
